    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather has initiated a formal [Meridian deployment gate](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1), mandating a signed release manifest for all staging and production environments. This shift is framed as a [corrective measure](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2) following past security lapses, moving from informal process to a [ratified decision](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) under his direct ownership. The discourse is characterized by a transition from [plain-spoken justification](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2) to [technical, matter-of-fact codification](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4), establishing a clear authority-ranking structure for release management.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The shift from reactive, plain-spoken explanation to rigid, formal decision-making." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "A binary oscillation between plain-spoken frustration and technical, matter-of-fact administrative language." ; narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
